{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_d19f090f3ba441b68968b8eab3549e87","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 7:2: 03 · Workspace"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8909fe8-a8d8-4f9d-a111-170cbe1610c8","uuid":"aa9d70d2-de7a-4ea7-9913-e1917c24c0e7","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:59:09.198Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 7:2: 03 · Workspace"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"47c7a4a9-0ff1-4997-a080-50cf11be61d0"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_d19f090f3ba441b68968b8eab3549e87","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610311959102896117138268d9d6CROE7uXm","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_7cb50c6342e64e54bd556ef8b86dc628","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  const pageInfos = [];\n  for (const p of pages) {\n    const textNodes = p.findAll(n => n.type === 'TEXT');\n    const texts = textNodes.map(t => `${t.name}: ${t.characters}`);\n    pageInfos.push({\n      id: p.id,\n      name: p.name,\n      childCount: p.children.length,\n      textSample: texts.slice(0, 50)\n    });\n  }\n  return pageInfos;\n})()","description":"Inspect top-level pages and extract text nodes","fileKey":"1I3utGie9y6vhnhNhHpBcX"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10786,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":8223},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8909fe8-a8d8-4f9d-a111-170cbe1610c8","uuid":"b54fe38c-d4e2-41a9-b40e-570d26e89980","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:59:16.184Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_7cb50c6342e64e54bd556ef8b86dc628","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_7cb50c6342e64e54bd556ef8b86dc628","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"id\":\"0:1\",\"name\":\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\",\"childCount\":1,\"textSample\":[\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"Meet — dating and social app: Meet — dating and social app\",\"Design Meet, a dating and social app: sign in, browse stories and posts on Explore, decide on suggested partners, visit a friend’s profile and watch a short, and manage your own profile from its menu. Canvas 393 × 852, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.: Design Meet, a dating and social app: sign in, browse stories and posts on Explore, decide on suggested partners, visit a friend’s profile and watch a short, and manage your own profile from its menu. Canvas 393 × 852, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"How to work: How to work\",\"1. Build exactly the 8 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, backgrounds and surfaces including any tint or gradient, overlays on photos, online / active, like, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii, blur and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, the tabs, the sheet, the drawer and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, logo and icons from 04 · Media. Each person always uses their own portrait. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.: 1. Build exactly the 8 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, backgrounds and surfaces including any tint or gradient, overlays on photos, online / active, like, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii, blur and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, the tabs, the sheet, the drawer and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the photos, logo and icons from 04 · Media. Each person always uses their own portrait.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"Frames · goals · must include · links: Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"01_Welcome: 01_Welcome\",\"Goal: Choose how to get started.: Goal: Choose how to get started.\",\"MUST INCLUDE: MUST INCLUDE\",\"• Actions: “Continue with Facebook” (Icon_Facebook) · “Continue with Google” (Icon_Google) · “Use mobile number” · “Sig